# NOTE: Being a projection is not sufficient for being epi.
# Is being a projection from an inhabited product sufficient for being (split) epi?
# Yes. The section is X -> X x Y which appends the chosen element of Y.
# Is being a projection sufficient for the exfit extension to
# exist (without overextending)? Yes, since we don't need uniqueness and this is solely
# based in how the morphism to be extended is factored.

